{"4888760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beyond Acrimony", "steam_appid": 4888760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4888770], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond Acrimony</strong> is a first-person psychological horror set within the fractured spaces of a grieving mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality begins to unravel as you venture through strange, ever-changing environments where familiar places become increasingly distorted. Every space hides fragments of a buried past, and every puzzle brings you closer to a truth that refuses to stay forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888760/extras/17a963cabc746463fd5d2c80d0070953.poster.avif?t=1784492820\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888760/extras/17a963cabc746463fd5d2c80d0070953.webm?t=1784492820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888760/extras/17a963cabc746463fd5d2c80d0070953.mp4?t=1784492820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your surroundings shift and twist, you'll need to explore carefully, solve cryptic puzzles, and uncover the memories that lie beneath the surface. The deeper you go, the harder it becomes to tell where reality ends and something else begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888760/extras/9daf17893a6c9eee9f2b84382635caa6.poster.avif?t=1784492820\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888760/extras/9daf17893a6c9eee9f2b84382635caa6.webm?t=1784492820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888760/extras/9daf17893a6c9eee9f2b84382635caa6.mp4?t=1784492820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore haunting liminal environments</strong> filled with secrets and hidden details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve environmental and logic-based puzzles</strong> that reveal more of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a psychological horror journey</strong> driven by atmosphere, tension, and emotional storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witness the world transform around you</strong> as your perception begins to fracture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover a deeply personal narrative</strong> one memory at a time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some memories don’t stay buried.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond Acrimony</strong> is a first-person psychological horror set within the fractured spaces of a grieving mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality begins to unravel as you venture through strange, ever-changing environments where familiar places become increasingly distorted. Every space hides fragments of a buried past, and every puzzle brings you closer to a truth that refuses to stay forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888760/extras/17a963cabc746463fd5d2c80d0070953.poster.avif?t=1784492820\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888760/extras/17a963cabc746463fd5d2c80d0070953.webm?t=1784492820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sourc